{"seq":2,"slug":"procedural-audio-performance","title":"性能与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/practice/procedural-audio-performance","wordCount":1594,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"性能与预算\">性能与预算</h1><p>合成的账单在性能分析器里赤裸裸地写着：一个采样声部播放时，CPU 几乎只花在解码和混音上；而一个物理建模或颗粒声部，每一帧都要跑完整的信号处理链，可能是采样声部的几十倍开销。当 50 个敌人同时被击中、暴雨配着引擎配着人群，朴素的合成方案会瞬间打爆音频线程预算，让帧率连锁崩盘。这一篇讲程序化音频怎么在 16 毫秒一帧的残酷约束下活下来——它是兑现整个 hub 价值的现实关卡，也是<a href=\"../foundations/synthesis-vs-samples\">合成与采样</a>里&quot;合成的 CPU 负债&quot;必须偿还的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>性能与预算</strong>讲程序化音频怎么在每帧的残酷约束下活下来。合成的总成本可粗略建模为各活跃声部成本之和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>V</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{V} c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，控制它不超预算就是优化的全部目标。相关核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三条主线</strong>：压声部数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、压单位成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>synth</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{synth}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">synth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、压复杂度 complexity。</li>\n<li><strong>声部管理</strong>：按距离/掩蔽/优先级剔除不可闻或不重要的声音（虚拟化）。</li>\n<li><strong>LOD 与缓存</strong>：LOD 让复杂度随重要性自适应下降，缓存复用不随帧变化的中间结果。</li>\n<li><strong>先测量再优化</strong>：用分析器找热点，低端平台理性地把光谱整体左移。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"音频预算-一帧能花多少\">音频预算：一帧能花多少</h2><p>游戏音频跑在专门的音频线程上，通常分到帧时间的一小块预算（常见量级是每帧 1–2 毫秒，或总 CPU 的几个百分点，具体随平台与项目而定）。超出这个预算，要么音频卡顿（buffer underrun，听感是爆音/断音），要么挤占其它线程拖垮帧率。合成的总成本可粗略建模为各活跃声部成本之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>V</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>synth</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>type</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>complexity</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}} = \\sum_{i=1}^{V} c_i, \\quad c_i = c_{\\text{synth}}(\\text{type}_i) \\cdot \\text{complexity}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">synth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">type</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">complexity</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是活跃声部数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个声部的单帧成本，由合成类型（加法&gt;颗粒&gt;物理建模&gt;减法&gt;采样，量级递减）和复杂度（模态数、颗粒密度、谐波数）共同决定。控制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不超预算，就是性能优化的全部目标，三条主线分别压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>synth</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{synth}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">synth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、压 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>complexity</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{complexity}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">complexity</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声部管理-给-v-设上限\">声部管理：给 V 设上限</h2><p>最直接的杠杆是限制活跃声部数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>。声部管理（voice management）的核心是：当请求的声音超过预算上限时，按优先级与可闻度做取舍——剔除（virtualize/cull）那些玩家根本听不到或不重要的声音。判据通常综合距离、响度、重要性标签：远处的、被更响声音掩蔽的、低优先级的声音被&quot;虚拟化&quot;（停止实际合成，只记录其逻辑状态以便需要时恢复）。下表是常见的剔除判据与处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>距离超阈</td>\n<td>远到几乎听不见</td>\n<td>虚拟化或退回静音</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被掩蔽</td>\n<td>被更响的声音盖住</td>\n<td>虚拟化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级低</td>\n<td>非关键音效</td>\n<td>超预算时优先剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同类过多</td>\n<td>同时 20 个脚步</td>\n<td>合并/限流到 N 个</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套优先级剔除与<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-audio\">事件驱动音频</a>天然契合——所有发声请求都经过总线，正好在那里集中做预算裁决。</p>\n<h2 id=\"lod-与缓存-压-complexity-与-c_synth\">LOD 与缓存：压 complexity 与 c_synth</h2><p>第二条主线是细节层级（LOD）：同一个声音在不同条件下用不同复杂度合成。近处的物理建模撞击跑全部 32 个模态，远处只跑最响的 4 个；近处的雨颗粒密度拉满，远处砍半。LOD 让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>complexity</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{complexity}_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">complexity</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随重要性自适应下降，是性价比最高的优化。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是缓存：合成里有大量&quot;不随帧变化&quot;的中间结果可以预算一次复用。固定材质的模态系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{f_k, d_k\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 不必每帧重算；不变参数下的合成片段可渲染成临时缓冲循环播放（即&quot;半采样化&quot;——把右端的纯合成临时退回光谱中段）。下面的图给出一次发声请求经过预算闸门的完整决策流：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  REQ[发声请求] --&gt; AUD{可闻度检查&lt;br/&gt;距离/掩蔽}&#10;  AUD --&gt;|不可闻| VIRT[虚拟化&lt;br/&gt;不占 CPU]&#10;  AUD --&gt;|可闻| BUDGET{声部预算还够?}&#10;  BUDGET --&gt;|不够| PRIO{优先级够高?}&#10;  PRIO --&gt;|否| DROP[剔除/限流]&#10;  PRIO --&gt;|是| EVICT[挤掉更低优先声部]&#10;  BUDGET --&gt;|够| LOD[按距离选 LOD&lt;br/&gt;降复杂度]&#10;  EVICT --&gt; LOD&#10;  LOD --&gt; CACHE{有可复用缓存?}&#10;  CACHE --&gt;|有| REUSE[复用缓冲]&#10;  CACHE --&gt;|无| SYNTH[实时合成]&#10;  REUSE --&gt; OUT[混音输出]&#10;  SYNTH --&gt; OUT\">flowchart TD\n  REQ[发声请求] --&gt; AUD{可闻度检查&lt;br/&gt;距离/掩蔽}\n  AUD --&gt;|不可闻| VIRT[虚拟化&lt;br/&gt;不占 CPU]\n  AUD --&gt;|可闻| BUDGET{声部预算还够?}\n  BUDGET --&gt;|不够| PRIO{优先级够高?}\n  PRIO --&gt;|否| DROP[剔除/限流]\n  PRIO --&gt;|是| EVICT[挤掉更低优先声部]\n  BUDGET --&gt;|够| LOD[按距离选 LOD&lt;br/&gt;降复杂度]\n  EVICT --&gt; LOD\n  LOD --&gt; CACHE{有可复用缓存?}\n  CACHE --&gt;|有| REUSE[复用缓冲]\n  CACHE --&gt;|无| SYNTH[实时合成]\n  REUSE --&gt; OUT[混音输出]\n  SYNTH --&gt; OUT</pre><h2 id=\"用分析器找热点-别凭感觉优化\">用分析器找热点，别凭感觉优化</h2><p>优化的铁律是先测量。中间件都带音频性能分析视图（Wwise 的 Profiler、FMOD 的 Profiler、Unreal 的 Audio Insights），能看到每个声部的 CPU 占用、活跃声部数、声部峰值。典型工作流是：跑一个最坏情况场景（大混战 + 恶劣天气），抓 CPU 尖峰，定位是哪类合成、哪个声音吃满了预算，再针对性地上 LOD 或调声部上限。凭直觉优化常常优化错地方——你以为贵的物理建模可能只占 5%，真正的杀手是某个忘了限流的高密度颗粒纹理。</p>\n<p>平台差异要前置考虑：移动端与 VR 的音频预算远紧于主机/PC（见<a href=\"../foundations/why-procedural-audio\">为何程序化音频</a>的内存表，CPU 同理）。在低端目标上，理性的做法常是把光谱整体左移——更多采样、更少实时合成，这正是<a href=\"hybrid-audio-practice\">混合落地</a>的核心权衡。这套&quot;测量-定位-降级&quot;的方法论，与 <code>50_game-procedural-animation</code> 实践篇处理动画 CPU 预算的思路完全平行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>合成是采样的几十倍单帧开销，朴素方案会在大混战中打爆<strong>音频线程预算</strong>（每帧约 1–2 ms 量级）。</li>\n<li>总成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>total</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{total}}=\\sum c_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">total</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，由声部数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>、合成类型、复杂度三者决定；优化即从这三处下手。</li>\n<li><strong>声部管理</strong>给 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 设上限：按距离/掩蔽/优先级剔除不可闻或不重要的声音（虚拟化），与事件总线契合。</li>\n<li><strong>LOD</strong> 压复杂度（远处少模态/低密度），<strong>缓存</strong>压重复合成（模态系数预算、半采样化），是性价比最高的手段。</li>\n<li>必须<strong>用分析器找热点</strong>再优化，别凭感觉；低端平台理性地把光谱左移（多采样少合成）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>偿还的是这笔债：<a href=\"../foundations/synthesis-vs-samples\">合成与采样</a></li>\n<li>预算裁决的契合点：<a href=\"../systems/event-driven-audio\">事件驱动音频</a></li>\n<li>光谱左移的落地：<a href=\"hybrid-audio-practice\">混合落地</a></li>\n<li>内存侧的同源约束：<a href=\"../foundations/why-procedural-audio\">为何程序化音频</a></li>\n<li>通用音频性能（本篇不重复）：<code>08_game-audio</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-audio/implementation/performance-memory\">性能与内存</a></li>\n<li>平行的预算方法论：<code>50_game-procedural-animation</code> 的<a href=\"../../game-procedural-animation/practice/procedural-performance\">程序化性能</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"性能与预算","id":"性能与预算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"音频预算：一帧能花多少","id":"音频预算-一帧能花多少"},{"level":2,"text":"声部管理：给 V 设上限","id":"声部管理-给-v-设上限"},{"level":2,"text":"LOD 与缓存：压 complexity 与 c_synth","id":"lod-与缓存-压-complexity-与-c_synth"},{"level":2,"text":"用分析器找热点，别凭感觉优化","id":"用分析器找热点-别凭感觉优化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"自适应音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/practice/adaptive-music"},"next":{"title":"混合落地","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-audio/practice/hybrid-audio-practice"}}